d class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">🍬5 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.40.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 7th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unobtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Weeping Willow</b> is an exclusive tree released in the Halloween 2023, 2024 and as well as the Halloween 2025 event. They spawn all around <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay\" title=\"Finlay\">Finlay</a>, but spawn in a large abundance near Mythril Forest/Junkyard. \n</p><p>Weeping Willow is the most common of the 3 new trees released. This can be sold for candy, the currency for this event, which can be used to purchase Halloween items at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Monstrous_Manor\" title=\"The Monstrous Manor\">The Monstrous Manor</a> and presents at other locations. \n</p><p>This is the tree with the most branches (It’s really troublesome to go to the background.)\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-b